OL,3,GNEWSAAir ambulance patient becomes
OL,4,Acharity's trustee
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who nearly lost his arm in a
OL,7,Fpiece of farm machinery has become a
OL,8,Ftrustee of the charity that helped save
OL,9,Fhis life.
OL,11,FPaul Reynolds, from Plaistow, West
OL,12,FSussex, was treated after the accident
OL,13,Fin November 2022 by a team from Air
OL,14,FAmbulance Charity Kent Surrey Sussex
OL,15,F(KSS), alongside an ambulance crew and
OL,16,Fthe fire service.
OL,18,FHe was taken by road to hospital in
OL,19,FBrighton and has since made a
OL,20,F"remarkable recovery", the charity
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
