OL,3,GNEWSAAir ambulance patient becomes
OL,4,Acharity's trustee
OL,5,
OL,6,FReynolds said: "Becoming a trustee has
OL,7,Fgiven me an opportunity to give
OL,8,Fsomething back to a charity that means
OL,9,Fso much to me."
